<title>USA: West Bend, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>West Bend, Wis., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said it won $3.250 million of West Bend, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true interest cost of 5.04.21 percent.</p>
</text>
